   18. The solar system                       public   carol 
   19. Human anatomy: bones and organs        public   carol 
   20. Physics: units and constants           private  carol 
   21. Biology: cells and genetics            private  carol 
   22. Weather and clouds                     public   carol 
   23. Mathematics: formulas                  public   carol 
   24. Algorithms and complexity              public   carol  [removed]
   25. Birds of Europe                        private  carol 
   26. Capitals of Europe                     private  dave  
   27. Capitals of Asia                       public   dave  
   28. Capitals of Africa                     public   dave  
   29. Rivers and mountains                   public   dave  
   30. Flags and national symbols             private  dave  
   31. Twentieth-century history              private  dave   [removed]
