    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001921', 4, N'Who was chained to a rock for giving fire to humanity?', NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 20, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 21, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001922', 4, N'Who opened a jar releasing every evil into the world?', NULL, 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 25, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 22, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001923', 4, N'Who looked back and lost his wife on the way out of the underworld?', NULL, 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 30, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 23, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001924', 4, N'Who was condemned to roll a boulder uphill for ever?', NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 15, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 24, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001925', 4, N'Who was doomed to prophesy truly and never be believed?', NULL, 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 20, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 25, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 1, '2026-07-25T09:00:00'),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001926', 2, N'Explain who the Titans were and what happened to them.', N'The older generation of gods, overthrown by Zeus and his siblings and imprisoned in Tartarus.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 1, 75, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 26, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001927', 2, N'Explain the myth of Persephone and what it explains.', N'Hades carried her to the underworld and her mother''s grief stopped growth; her yearly return accounts for the seasons.', 1, NULL, 0, 90, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 27, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001928', 2, N'Explain what a Greek hero was, and how it differs from the modern sense.', N'A figure of exceptional descent and deeds, often flawed and dangerous, honoured after death rather than morally admirable.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 45, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 28, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001929', 2, N'Explain what hubris means and how myths treat it.', N'Overreaching pride against the gods or the natural order, which the stories punish without fail.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 60, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 29, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001930', 2, N'Explain the story of the Trojan horse.', N'The Greeks feigned withdrawal leaving a hollow horse; the Trojans took it inside and the hidden soldiers opened the gates at night.', 1, NULL, 0, 75, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 30, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001931', 2, N'Explain who the Fates were and what they did.', N'Three sisters who spun, measured and cut the thread of every life, binding even the gods.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 90, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 31, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001932', 2, N'Explain the story of Oedipus in outline.', N'He unknowingly killed his father and married his mother, fulfilling the prophecy he had fled, and blinded himself when the truth came out.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 45, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 32, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001933', 2, N'Explain what the Sirens were and how Odysseus survived them.', N'Creatures whose song lured sailors to wreck; he stopped his crew''s ears with wax and had himself tied to the mast.', 1, NULL, 0, 60, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 33, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001934', 2, N'Explain the difference between Greek and Roman names for the same gods.', N'The Romans identified their own gods with the Greek ones, so Zeus became Jupiter, Ares Mars and Aphrodite Venus.', 0, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 75, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 34, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001935', 2, N'Explain what a metamorphosis myth is and give an example.', N'A story ending in transformation, as Daphne becomes a laurel tree to escape Apollo.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 90, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 35, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001936', 3, N'Who are the twelve Olympians, and where were they said to live?', N'The principal gods, on Mount Olympus.', 1, NULL, 0, 75, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 36, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001937', 3, N'What was the golden apple inscribed with, and what did it start?', N'"To the fairest", and the quarrel that led to the judgement of Paris and the Trojan War.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 90, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 37, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001938', 3, N'What is the Odyssey about, and how long did the journey take?', N'Odysseus''s return from Troy, which took ten years.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 105, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 38, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001939', 3, N'Who was Charon, and what did he require?', N'The ferryman of the dead, who required a coin for the crossing.', 1, NULL, 1, 120, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 39, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001940', 3, N'What was Cerberus, and which labour involved him?', N'The three-headed dog guarding the underworld, fetched in the twelfth labour of Heracles.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 60, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 40, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001941', 3, N'Who was Atlas condemned to do, and why?', N'To hold up the sky, as punishment for siding with the Titans.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 75, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 41, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001942', 3, N'What was the Oracle at Delphi, and who spoke there?', N'The shrine of Apollo where the Pythia gave ambiguous answers.', 1, NULL, 0, 90, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 42, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001943', 3, N'What is a chimera, in the original myth?', N'A fire-breathing creature part lion, part goat and part serpent.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 105, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 43, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001944', 3, N'Who was Narcissus, and what became of him?', N'A youth who fell in love with his reflection and wasted away, leaving the flower that bears his name.', 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 120, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 44, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001945', 1, N'Draw a family tree of the Olympian gods from memory.', NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 180, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 45, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001946', 1, N'Read one myth aloud to someone and then retell it in your own words.', NULL, 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 240, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 46, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001947', 1, N'Find five English words that come from Greek myth and explain each.', NULL, 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 300, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 47, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001948', 1, N'Watch a film based on a Greek myth and list what it changed.', NULL, 1, NULL, 0, 360, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 48, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001949', 1, N'Learn the twelve labours of Heracles in order.', NULL, 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 420, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 49, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 0, NULL),
    (N'B0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001950', 1, N'Explain to someone what hubris means, using a myth as the example.', NULL, 1, N'Robert Graves, The Greek Myths', 0, 180, N'A0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000039', 50, '2026-02-20T09:00:00', 1, '2026-07-25T09:00:00');

